                <pb facs="0675" n="577" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg577"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Choate to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram in cipher—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Choate states that the American owners of cargo in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Mashona</hi> should prove their damages, if any, in
                    prize court.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
